Licensing note for the lexsync package
======================================

The MIT licence declared in DESCRIPTION covers the source code of this package
only. The example lexica in inst/extdata are derived from third-party data and are
distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
The terms, the changes lexsync made and the credit they require are set out in
inst/COPYRIGHTS. R does not install this file, but it installs that one, as
COPYRIGHTS in the package's directory, where
system.file("COPYRIGHTS", package = "lexsync") finds it.
